 to regenerate the completion_context at this point, as it would solve the problem pointed out by @kitbdev - next function's completion context failed to create, but was setting a bool nonetheless. Unfortunately, I can't do it, because it fails at:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n\tif (previous.cursor_place != GDScriptTokenizerText::CURSOR_MIDDLE && previous.cursor_place != GDScriptTokenizerText::CURSOR_END && current.cursor_place == GDScriptTokenizerText::CURSOR_NONE) {\r\n\t\treturn false;\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nwhich isn't surprising as the token parsing advanced beyond the point of first context creation.","created_at":"2025-04-29T15:53:53Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T16:20:52Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105528#discussion_r2066876036","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105528","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2066876036"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105528#discussion_r2066876036"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105528"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2066876036/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":1633,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2061221639,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":98,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]